# Build output is ignored, with one deliberate exception: the program keypair is a
# throwaway localnet identity with no funds and no upgrade authority worth stealing,
# and without it the `declare_id!` in each program cannot be deployed by anyone else
# on the team. A real deployment key would never be committed.
target/
!target/
target/*
!target/deploy/
target/deploy/*
!target/deploy/world-keypair.json
!target/deploy/registry-keypair.json
!target/deploy/org-keypair.json
